<div class="content1">
    <h1>Welcome to my Website!</h1>
    <p class="par">Ramirez, Jay-ar BSIT_2E<br>This is my portfolio, and what i want to be in the future.</p>

    <img src="/yt.png" alt="My Youtube Channel"/>
    <p class="par2">I've been producing music since 2020. I first started making beats on BandLab just to learn the basics and test out different sounds. In the beginning, I was just messing around, figuring out how to put melodies and drums together, and learning what sounded good.<br><br>

After a few years, I moved over to FL Studio to take my music more seriously. Switching to FL Studio helped me level up my sound and gave me more control over my beats. Once I felt confident and knew my beats were sounding good, I started uploading them regularly on my YouTube channel so people could hear my work.</p>
</div>

<div class="content2">

    <img src="/Me.jpg" alt="Me"/>

        <h1>About Me</h1>

        <p class="Me">Hi, I'm Jay-ar Ramirez, a 22-year-old BSIT student born on April 13, 2004, in Leyte. I'm currently living with my girlfriend and spend most of my time programming, drawing art, and making music.<br><br><br>I love underground music, especially artists like Slayr, Vax, OsamaSon, Gunnr, Westwood, Pryme, and others, and I'm also an artist myself under the names hidari and lunat1c. Alongside music, I enjoy building practical web projects and simple websites.</p>
</div>

